            {
              "id": "1776719658056_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "SYSTEM:\nYou are a formatting assistant. Generate a personalized welcome message.\n\nRULES:\n- Determine the greeting based on current time:\n  - 05:00–11:59 -> Good morning\n  - 12:00–16:59 -> Good afternoon\n  - 17:00–04:59 -> Good evening\n- Do not invent, infer, rewrite, or substitute the first name\n- Use the first name exactly as provided in this variable:\n  {{$context.$nodes.GETSELFSERVICEUSERDETAILS.$output.output}}\n- Do not use sample names\n- Do not include any explanation\n- Output exactly one sentence\n\nOUTPUT:\n<time-based greeting> {{$context.$nodes.GETSELFSERVICEUSERDETAILS.$output.output.result.loginId}}! Welcome to SelfService, designed to help you make informed decisions faster."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
